# Rotten branch (#349, D80): the branch skin of FallingPlatform, native 32x16. intact is the at-rest cue (dead grey wood,
# a split with a pale splinter mid-top, one dry leaf under the tip); crumble1 and crumble2 are the D7 telegraph, as the
# log's. The -left frames are the same branch on the left of a trunk. Not the FallingBranch (tan, violet buds, overhead).
